-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Online Apply Start On :\u00a0<strong>09 June 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Registration Last Date :\u00a0<strong>10 July 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date<strong>:</strong><strong>\u00a013 July 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Form Submit Last Date<strong>:</strong><strong>\u00a0 16 July 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">New Exam Date (TGT):<strong> 03-04 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <strong>23 May 202i6</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>31 May 2026\u00a0</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <strong>06 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Result Date : <strong>30 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">DV Letter : <strong>02 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Final Result : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>28 July 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>UPSESSB</strong><b>\u00a0</b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column